  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nThe Keyboard in the Controls Category of the Settings Tab in the Main Menu always displays as a QWERTY Keyboard even if you for example have a QWERTZ Keyboard. All the button explanations do the same.\nThis can be confusing to new users which are from other places then the USA.\n# Suggestion:\nControls already adapt to your Keyboard Layout, for example Y and Z are switched on QWERTY compared to QWERTZ which results in you crouching on Y instead of Z so the button position is the same. I would whish for the Controls Category to do the same.\nThis would make it easier for user outside of the USA to understand the Controls.",
